OL,3,ATanzania celebrates first natural gas
OL,4,Adiscovery in more than 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FTanzania has announced a significant
OL,7,Fdiscovery of natural gas in the Mnazi
OL,8,FBay area in the south of the country -
OL,9,Fthe first such find in a decade.
OL,11,FEnergy Minister Juma Homera attended a
OL,12,Fceremony at the Kasa-1X ST2 well, which
OL,13,Fis jointly owned by state-owned
OL,14,FTanzania Petroleum Development
OL,15,FCorporation (TPDC) and French oil firm
OL,16,FMaurel & Prom, to mark the occasion.
OL,18,FHe said the estimated 223 billion cubic
OL,19,Ffeet (6.3 billion cubic metres)
OL,20,Fdiscovery was a "major milestone" in
OL,21,Fthe development of the small oil and
OL,22,Fgas sector in the East African nation.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
